I(eps) closed form = (-sqrt(2)*pi*(A*epsilon - B*epsilon + W0)*exp((A*epsilon - B*epsilon + W0)**2/2)*erf(sqrt(2)*(A*epsilon - B*epsilon + W0)/2)/2 + sqrt(2)*pi*(A*epsilon - B*epsilon + W0)*exp((A*epsilon - B*epsilon + W0)**2/2)/2)*exp(-A**2*epsilon**2 + 2*A*B*epsilon**2 - 2*A*W0*epsilon - B**2*epsilon**2 + 2*B*W0*epsilon - W0**2)/(2*sqrt(pi)*(A*epsilon - B*epsilon + W0)) - (-sqrt(2)*pi*(A*epsilon + W0)*(-B*epsilon/(A*epsilon + W0) + 1)*exp((A*epsilon + W0)**2*(-B*epsilon/(A*epsilon + W0) + 1)**2/2)*erf(sqrt(2)*(A*epsilon + W0)*(-B*epsilon/(A*epsilon + W0) + 1)/2)/2 - sqrt(2)*pi*(A*epsilon + W0)*(-B*epsilon/(A*epsilon + W0) + 1)*exp((A*epsilon + W0)**2*(-B*epsilon/(A*epsilon + W0) + 1)**2/2)/2)*exp(-A**2*epsilon**2 + 2*A*B*epsilon**2 - 2*A*W0*epsilon - B**2*epsilon**2 + 2*B*W0*epsilon - W0**2)/(sqrt(pi)*(2*A*epsilon + 2*W0)*(-B*epsilon/(A*epsilon + W0) + 1))
